{"entities":[{"pmid":"8475949","text":"pentamidine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":13,"end":24},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"ventricular tachycardia","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017180","start":41,"end":64},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"Pentamidine isethionate","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":76,"end":99},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"ventricular tachyarrhythmias","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017180","start":125,"end":153},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"torsade de pointes","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D016171","start":165,"end":183},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"Pentamidine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":277,"end":288},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"torsade de pointes","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D016171","start":297,"end":315},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"magnesium","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D008274","start":340,"end":349},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"hypomagnesemia","etype":"Disease","mesh":"C537153","start":361,"end":375},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"Torsade de pointes","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D016171","start":412,"end":430},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"pentamidine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":486,"end":497},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"pentamidine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":549,"end":560},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"Torsade de pointes","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D016171","start":576,"end":594},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"pentamidine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010419","start":669,"end":680},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"QTc interval prolongation","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D008133","start":687,"end":712},{"pmid":"8475949","text":"magnesium","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D008274","start":732,"end":741}],"gold_relations":"pentamidine | CID | Torsade de pointes","metrics":{"precision":0.16666666666666666,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.2857142857142857,"tp":1,"fp":5,"fn":0,"rel_precision":0.16666666666666666,"rel_recall":1.0,"rel_f1":0.2857142857142857,"rel_tp":1,"rel_fp":5,"rel_fn":0},"pmid":"8475949","relations":["D010419 | CID | D014693","D008274 | CID | D010419","D008274 | CID | D016171","D010419 | CID | D016171","D008274 | CID | D008133","D010419 | CID | omim:613882"],"text":"Case report: pentamidine and polymorphic ventricular tachycardia revisited. Pentamidine isethionate has been associated with ventricular tachyarrhythmias, including torsade de pointes. This article reports two cases of this complication and reviews all reported cases to date. Pentamidine-induced torsade de pointes may be related to serum magnesium levels and hypomagnesemia may synergistically induce torsade. Torsade de pointes occurred after an average of 10 days of treatment with pentamidine. In these patients, no other acute side effects of pentamidine were observed. Torsade de pointes can be treated when recognized early, possibly without discontinuation of pentamidine. When QTc interval prolongation is observed, early magnesium supplementation is advocated."}